        "description": {
          "text": "Expanded CF indication to add 280 ultra-rare CFTR variants responsive based on clinical/in vitro data or resulting in CFTR protein production",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental new drug application provides for an expansion of the indication of Alyftrek (VNZ/TEZ/D-IVA) tablets for the treatment of cystic fibrosis (CF) in adult and pediatric patients aged 6 years and older who have a clinical diagnosis of CF and who have at least one variant in the cystic fibrosis transmembrane conductance regulator (CFTR) gene that is either responsive based on clinical and/or in vitro data or results in production of CFTR protein. This indication expansion is based on 280 ultra-rare CFTR variants included in Section 12 of the Prescribing Information.",
              "doc_id": "b89c1ab0-eab5-55f9-ba43-b7340467f27f",
